config IS31FL3741
	bool "IS31FL3741 LED driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ISSI_IS31FL3741_ENABLED
	select I2C
	help
	  Enable LED driver for IS31FL3741.
	  IS31FL3741 is a matrix LED driver, capable of a maximum of 3.75 mA
	  per LED, or 38 mA total across all LEDs in the 39x9 dot matrix.
